<%# Created: 2026-02-17 %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>실무.kr에 오신 것을 환영합니다</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%); padding: 48px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 15px; margin: 0; }
    .body { padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 17px; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .features { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .features h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; margin: 0 0 16px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .feature-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .feature-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .feature-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .feature-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; margin: 0 0 2px; }
    .feature-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0; }
    .cta { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; }
    .footer { border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.8; }
    .footer a { color: #6366f1; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>실무.kr에 오신 것을 환영합니다!</h1>
      <p>공무원 계약·예산 실무를 더 쉽게</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">
        안녕하세요,<br>
        <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>으로 가입해 주셔서 감사합니다.<br>
        실무.kr은 공무원의 계약·예산 업무를 돕는 무료 서비스입니다.
      </p>

      <div class="features">
        <h3>주요 기능 안내</h3>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#ede9fe;">🔧</div>
          <div>
            <p class="feature-title">19가지 업무 자동화 도구</p>
            <p class="feature-desc">계약방식 결정, 예정가격 계산, 공문서 작성 등 반복 업무를 즉시 처리</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#d1fae5;">📖</div>
          <div>
            <p class="feature-title">법령·업무 가이드 47개</p>
            <p class="feature-desc">수의계약, 입찰, 검수, 예산 업무를 단계별로 안내</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#fef3c7;">📋</div>
          <div>
            <p class="feature-title">실무 서식 템플릿 23개</p>
            <p class="feature-desc">자주 쓰는 공문서·서식을 바로 다운로드</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background:#fee2e2;">🔍</div>
          <div>
            <p class="feature-title">감사사례 55건</p>
            <p class="feature-desc">감사 지적 사례로 미리 대비</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta">
        <%= link_to "실무.kr 바로가기", "https://silmu.kr", class: "cta-btn" %>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size:14px; color:#64748b; text-align:center; line-height:1.8;">
        궁금한 점이 있으시면 <a href="https://silmu.kr/feedback" style="color:#6366f1;">의견보내기</a>를 이용해 주세요.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        실무.kr · <a href="https://silmu.kr/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a> · <a href="https://silmu.kr/terms">이용약관</a><br>
        본 메일은 회원가입 시 자동 발송됩니다.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
